; the url action policies of the security zones, as Windows ships them in its software hive. urlmon reads the number of
; an action from the zone's key, and the zone is the one the zone map gives the url. 0 is the computer, 1 the intranet,
; 2 trusted sites, 3 the internet and 4 restricted sites. a policy is 0 to allow, 1 to prompt and 3 to disallow. the
; lockdown zones are the same zones for programs under the local machine lockdown, and a template is the set of
; policies a security level resets a zone to.

